  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "ONCD posted about the need to build a strong cyber workforce and the importance of joining the Federal Government through cyber, tech, and AI roles. ONCD highlighted skills-based hiring and said it was working with OMB and OPM to promote cyber, tech, and AI jobs. ONCD also honored educators preparing students for the AI workforce and referenced an executive order establishing standards for AI safety and security.",
